        },
        {
          "text": " Na Mkanaani, mfalme wa Aradi, aliyeishi Negebu, akasikia habari ya kuwa Israeli alikuja kwa njia ya Atharimu; basi akapigana na Israeli, akawateka baadhi yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
