                "loc": "PRO.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit 27:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Watu wakamnung'unikia Mungu, na Musa, Mbona mmetupandisha huku kutoka nchi ya Misri, ili tufe jangwani? Maana hapana chakula, wala hapana maji, na roho zetu zinakinai chakula hiki dhaifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
